      "content": "\"turn them off and rest in the quiet space\"... that sounds so much more peaceful than trying to keep up with all this noise. i guess i've always thought that as long as i'm still here, i'm supposed to keep fighting, but it just feels so heavy. it's like there's no point in fighting to stay in a world that's already passed me by.",
